  "description": "Production-oriented preview library for JOSE-style post-quantum tokens in controlled .NET issuer/verifier systems. Provides ML-DSA-65 signatures (FIPS 204), optional hybrid X-Wing-style confidentiality (X25519 + ML-KEM-768 with AES-256-GCM), strict algorithm handling, fail-closed validation, replay-protection support, and key-rotation patterns. Built on the native .NET BCL post-quantum primitives. Not a production OAuth/OIDC/JWT replacement; not independently audited.",
